INSERT INTO "niv" ("verseid","versenumber","chapternumber","book","verse") VALUES (3875,23,7,'Num','and two oxen, five rams, five male goats and five male lambs a year old, to be sacrificed as a fellowship offering. This was the offering of Nethanel son of Zuar.');
INSERT INTO "niv" ("verseid","versenumber","chapternumber","book","verse") VALUES (3876,24,7,'Num','On the third day, Eliab son of Helon, the leader of the people of Zebulun, brought his offering.');
INSERT INTO "niv" ("verseid","versenumber","chapternumber","book","verse") VALUES (3877,25,7,'Num','His offering was one silver plate weighing a hundred and thirty shekels, and one silver sprinkling bowl weighing seventy shekels, both according to the sanctuary shekel, each filled with fine flour mixed with oil as a grain offering;');
